{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわんこ！\n伊藤純奈です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/05/27/1765390/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月のBLTで黒カメラを\n担当してるのでぜひチェックしてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/05/27/1765390/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握@パシフィコ横浜\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/05/27/1765390/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に髪を下ろしてたからいつもより\n大人っぽいってたくさん言われた♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/05/27/1765390/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカートが床と同化して見にくいけど\n黒のタイトスカートだよ( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が会いに来て下さって\n楽しかったです！またよろしくです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/05/27/1765390/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間の、のぎるーむは\nボーダー組でした！パジャマで\n収録なんて楽しいだろうなーって\n思ってたから出れて嬉しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/05/27/1765390/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジェラートピケのパジャマだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この髪型は初めてやったんだけど\nたくさん褒めて頂けたからまた\nやろうかな(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも大人しそうとかクールとか\nそんな感じのイメージをもたれる方が\n多いんだけど、のぎるーむで見て頂けた\n通り割といじられキャラです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと皆さんに純の性格を\n知ってもらいたいなぁ。もっとブログとか\nモバメとか755でいっぱい素出してくね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/05/27/1765390/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛テスト期間なうなので\nお供であるウーロン茶とガムと\n一緒に頑張ります！！\nテスト期間の皆さん、\n一緒に頑張ろうね(^○^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/05/27/1765390/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさーい！"}],"source":"archive"}